&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Is The Role :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;51ou4&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8t7s9-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8t7s9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8t7s9-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8t7s9-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Engineering Productivity&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;8t7s9-0-2&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;team operates the CI, CD, and Release infrastructure for the company. We ensure developers can efficiently and safely deploy changes across our various environments and at scale. In an age of AI, the landscape is evolving rapidly from scaling needs to, more than ever, securing our supply chain. There are interesting challenges to tackle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;8t7s9-0-0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;51ou4&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;p8tt-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;p8tt-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;p8tt-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for a proactive systems thinker who delivers on business-driven projects while identifying and driving the work that keeps our infrastructure ahead before scaling and security challenges become problems. If you&#39;re energized by work that makes every engineering team at Elastic ship faster and more securely, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
